                <pb facs="1197" n="1081" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1081"/>

                <head>Arbitration agreement between the United States and Spain, extending the
                    duration of the Convention of April 20, 1908</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, May 29, 1913; ratification advised
                        by the Senate, February 21, 1914; ratified by the President, March 9, 1914;
                        ratified by Spain, March 2, 1914; ratifications exchanged at Washington,
                        March 21, 1914; proclaimed, March 23, 1914</hi>.</p>

